    "text": ":rotating_light: OLake Go v0.7.8 Released:rotating_light:\nRelease: \u003chttps://github.com/datazip-inc/olake/releases/tag/v0.7.8|github.com/datazip-inc/…/v0.7.8\u003e\n*What’s New*\n• fix(postgres): lsn mismatch validation when slot already matches metadata-committed LSN by \u003c@U08S5BR47GA\u003e in \u003chttps://github.com/datazip-inc/olake/pull/998|#998\u003e\n• fix: bump \u003chttp://golang.org/x/net|golang.org/x/net\u003e to v0.55.0 to fix trivy-go CI failures by \u003c@U08S5BR47GA\u003e in \u003chttps://github.com/datazip-inc/olake/pull/1004|#1004\u003e\n• feat: add bulk read path for backfill and incremental sync DB2 by \u003c@U08S0TP9R3P\u003e in \u003chttps://github.com/datazip-inc/olake/pull/990|#990\u003e\n:rotating_light: OLake Helm v0.0.25 Released:rotating_light:\n:link: \u003chttps://github.com/datazip-inc/olake-helm/releases/tag/olake-0.0.25|github.com/datazip-inc/…/olake-0.0.25\u003e\n:rocket: Features \u0026 Fixes in this release:\n• feat: fusion external pg existing secret by \u003c@U08H6LN432P\u003e in \u003chttps://github.com/datazip-inc/olake-helm/pull/175|#175\u003e\n• feat: probe zombie processes by \u003c@U08H6LN432P\u003e in \u003chttps://github.com/datazip-inc/olake-helm/pull/176|#176\u003e\n:memo: Note: Previous chart versions used a timeout wrapper in liveness/readiness probe commands. In containers, this caused child processes to accumulate as zombies over time on the underlying node. v0.0.25 removes the timeout wrapper. Probes now run commands directly, eliminating the zombie process buildup.\n\nThanks for the contribution!",
